# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Capacitor / Android build output
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/capacitor-cordova-android-plugins/

# Environment / secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.keystore
*.jks
google-services.json

# ...but the Android one MUST be committed. It is not a secret: it ships inside
# every APK and Google documents it as public (the customer app commits its own
# in kofy-website). Codemagic builds from the repo, so if this file is missing
# the build produces an APK with the push plugin and NO Firebase config — which
# is exactly the native launch crash v0.2 removed the plugin to fix.
!android/app/google-services.json

# System
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Logs
*.log
